# Worker runtime configuration is in wrangler.jsonc (public) or wrangler.local.jsonc (local).
# Local secrets: copy .dev.vars.example to .dev.vars.
# Production secrets, entered with `npx wrangler secret put NAME`:
# MEDIA_SIGNING_KEY: 64 lowercase hex characters, generated randomly (32 bytes).
# OAUTH_OWNER_SUB: the exact subject/user_id of your personal OAuth account.
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY: optional, only for later explicit ElevenLabs use.
# Keep ENABLE_PAID_GENERATION="false" in wrangler.jsonc.
# Do not put Cloudflare account tokens or OAuth client secrets in Worker public vars.
